{
  "text": "But you understand what's even more important, but you, you were able to like hold space for both things. Yeah. I'm able to hold space because my my craft keeps me. Busy, it keeps me sane. It keeps me, you know, focused. It gives me structure. But at the end of the day, I don't come home to an award and. You know what I mean? I come to my dogs and my husband and that's what brings me joy. And I'm like, All of this can go away. What's important in life is connection. And that's what I hold true to me. Do you feel like your music has allowed you to explore that healing? I could feel like we have a window into some of your most painful moments.",
